  "channel": "rent",
  "description": "Offering an enticing blend of charm, natural light and modern living - this home does not disappoint!<br/><br/>TOP 8 REASONS TO LEASE ME:<br/>1. Spacious two bedroom, two bathroom unfurnished apartment located on level 1.<br/>2. Attractive wood finished flooring for added luxury and a low maintenance lifestyle.<br/>3. Contemporary and functional kitchen with abundant storage and bench space, complete with stainless steel appliances including a dishwasher.<br/>4. The living quarters flow out onto a balcony with leafy green outlook.<br/>5. Both bedrooms are generously sized and feature mirrored built-in robes. The master bedroom even includes its own private modern ensuite!<br/>6. Extra features include an additional bathroom/laundry combination with dryer included for your convenience and split-system reverse-cycle air-conditioning to the living area for your year round comfort.<br/>7. Fully secure building with pin code entry and remote garage access for your peace of mind.<br/>8. Unbeatable Northbridge location - only a short walk to restaurants, nightlife, Perth Arena, Perth CBD, transport links and all that this location has on offer! Commuting is a breeze with quick freeway access and public transport right at your doorstep. <br/><br/>PARKING: One secure car bay provided.<br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: Access to the apartment is by stairs only. Furniture in photos is for staging purposes only and is not included. No storeroom included.<br/><br/>LEASE TERM: 12 months preferred.<br/><br/>*Sorry, no pets are permitted in the complex as per the by-laws.<br/><br/>VIEWING: Click GET IN TOUCH or BOOK INSPECTION to confirm an appointment by following the links and prompts or contact our Leasing Executive Toyah Dent on 0488 388 604 / 9200 6168 or leasing@re88.com.au - If no time is currently available, register your interest and you will be alerted when the next inspection time is scheduled.<br/><br/>PLEASE NOTE: If you do not correctly register for a viewing, the time that you saw may not go ahead. Please remember to enter your correct details to stay updated with the home open time and any changes/cancellations that may occur. <br/><br/>IMPORTANT: Applications will not be accepted without a prior viewing either in person or virtually. <br/><br/>DON'T MISS OUT: Please be on time or early to your viewing so you have sufficient time to find parking and locate the property, fully inspect and ensure that it is suitable for your needs, as viewing start times cannot be extended and we cannot wait for you beyond the start time if you are late.",
